# Android signing material. The keystore and its passwords must never be
# committed: this repository is public, and a secret in history outlives the
# commit that removed it. Passwords come from TMUX_NEXT_STORE_PASS and
# TMUX_NEXT_KEY_PASS in the environment; the store itself stays in app/keystore/.
*.jks
*.keystore
keystore.properties
app/keystore/
